  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/Kosovo Local Works Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Local Works Activity is to increase socio-economic cohesion among target communitiesKosovo Roma, Ashkali, and Egyptianthrough the facilitation of sustainable recycling models led by the private sector and in cooperation with communities and local governments. For the purpose of this activity the target stakeholder communities can be defined broadly as marginalized groups (Roma, Ashkali, and Egyptian communities, youth, women and girls)</narrative>
  </description>
